        "created_at": "2016-12-03T12:47:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>@<span>MindWanderer:</span></p><p><span>...I never connected before that Setback was a part of the same experiment as Spite.</span></p><p><span>I had thought it was two totally separate experiments. Baron Blade trying to figure out how to enhance himself produced Setback, while Spite was a product of The Chairman doing experiments in Pike Industries presumably for more stuff to sell.</span></p><p><span>@</span><span>Arcanist Lupus:</span></p><p><span>Ooh, I like the way you think.</span></p>",
