        "created_at": "2016-12-03T13:01:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Spite and Setback aren't part of the same set of experiments. &nbsp;Spite had the drugs tested on him at Pike Industries and Setback's experiments were done at RevoCorp. &nbsp; Setback's powers came about due to Baron Blade trying to reverse engineer his regression serum. &nbsp; &nbsp;Spite's drug testing were part of the Chairman's experiments &nbsp;in the&nbsp;<span>Barzakh Wing of Pike Laboratories&nbsp;</span><span>and he later uses some of the drugs himself to become Exemplar in Sentinel Tactics.</span></p>",
